<title>FRANCE: United, ups ex-Paris cargo rates 7.5pct May.</title>
<headline>United, ups ex-Paris cargo rates 7.5pct May.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Airlines said it will raise its ex-Paris air cargo rates by 7.5 percent from May 5.</p>
<p>UAL withdrew its fuel surcharge on April 7. The airline operates daily flights from Paris to Chicago and Washington using Boeing 777 passenger aircraft.</p>
<p>From July 1997, the airline will replace 767-300s on its daily service between Paris and San Francisco with 777s with cargo capacity increasing from seven to 12 tonnes per flight to 15 tonnes, UAL added. --Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542-7706 Fax+5017</p>
</text>
